---
// Two alternating feature rows: image on one side, copy with a three-item checklist on the other; the second row is mirrored.
---

<section class="bg-surface py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20">
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-card border border-line bg-bg p-2 shadow-xl shadow-brand-950/10">
        <img src="/media/app-dashboard.svg" alt="Halcyon's weekly plan view with priorities grouped by project" width="1440" height="900" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-line" />
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest text-brand-600 uppercase dark:text-brand-400">Plan</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance text-fg sm:text-4xl">One plan the whole team can actually read</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-pretty text-muted">Every Monday, Halcyon gathers what is in flight and helps you choose what the week is really about. The result fits on a single screen.</p>

        <ul class="mt-8 space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-600 text-white">
              <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span class="text-base leading-7 text-fg">Three priorities per person, never a wall of tickets</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-600 text-white">
              <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span class="text-base leading-7 text-fg">Unfinished work rolls forward with a note, not a guilt trip</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-600 text-white">
              <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span class="text-base leading-7 text-fg">Share a read-only link with clients and stakeholders</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-20 grid items-center gap-12 sm:mt-28 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20">
      <div class="lg:order-2">
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-card border border-line shadow-xl shadow-brand-950/10">
          <img src="/media/abstract-3.svg" alt="Abstract gradient artwork suggesting a quiet evening sky" width="1600" height="1000" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full object-cover" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:order-1">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest text-brand-600 uppercase dark:text-brand-400">Focus</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance text-fg sm:text-4xl">Protect the hours where real work happens</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-pretty text-muted">Halcyon assumes your attention is valuable. Updates arrive in batches, on your schedule, and anything urgent has to say why.</p>

        <ul class="mt-8 space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-600 text-white">
              <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span class="text-base leading-7 text-fg">Quiet Hours hold notifications until you are back at your desk</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-600 text-white">
              <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span class="text-base leading-7 text-fg">A single morning digest replaces the scroll through every channel</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-600 text-white">
              <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span class="text-base leading-7 text-fg">Focus blocks sync with your calendar so nobody books over them</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
